	(text "DRV8251A (SLVSFU6): IN1/IN2 from the Teensy (1k in series on the main board; internal\n100k pull-downs: coast + sleep at reset).  IPROPI 1575 uA/A into 2k0 = 3.15 V/A; I_TRIP =\nVREF / (1575u x 2k0) = 0.93 A.  IPROPI goes down the ribbon to the 10k + 10n at the Teensy."
